Alembic migrations for the EventPark database. See ../alembic.ini for commands.

Rules (CLAUDE.md §8):
- one revision per schema change;
- never edit a migration that has been applied anywhere (write a new one instead);
- autogenerate is a draft: always read it before committing (it misses CHECK constraints,
  extensions, data changes and renames, which it sees as drop + add).
